<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-11631] Server node with PDS and SSL fails on start with NPE</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11631</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Server node fails with NPE, if persistence and SSL are enable. &lt;br/&gt;
Stacktrace:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
